WEBVTT

00:03.460 --> 00:08.730
<i>With Sylvie's help, we were able 
to escape the tomb of terror.</i>

00:09.480 --> 00:13.610
<i>Afterwards, members of the guild 
visited the Elder Wood's chamber,</i>

00:13.610 --> 00:19.640
<i>retrieving Brald's body 
and Reginald's belongings.</i>

00:21.400 --> 00:27.320
<i>It became clear later that this quest 
was not arranged through the guild.</i>

00:28.160 --> 00:31.750
<i>Samantha survived, but was hurt badly 
enough that even after healing,</i>

00:32.060 --> 00:34.520
<i>she wouldn't be able to 
continue as an adventurer.</i>

00:35.930 --> 00:40.570
<i>I keep thinking about how 
Reginald and Brald died...</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:51.010
<i>We were going to be called on to testify 
to what happened in the dungeon.</i>

00:56.570 --> 00:59.120
Arthur. Thank you for getting in touch.

00:59.680 --> 01:02.440
My ring let me know that 
you were in danger,

01:02.440 --> 01:05.560
I was so worried I didn't know
 what to do with myself.

01:05.560 --> 01:06.870
But it's good to know you're okay.

02:45.770 --> 02:50.790
#8 The King's Day In Court.

02:52.810 --> 02:55.780
So, you survived.

02:56.100 --> 02:56.790
Yeah.

02:57.270 --> 02:59.210
You've got the devil's own luck.

03:06.330 --> 03:09.150
Let's go. I have a job for you all.

03:11.330 --> 03:12.420
Have a seat.

03:15.780 --> 03:20.870
I'll get straight to the point. What 
exactly happened in that dungeon?

03:21.830 --> 03:24.250
I'd like to hear your take on it.

03:32.900 --> 03:33.650
Jasmine?

03:34.090 --> 03:36.730
Is Note around? Where is he?

03:36.730 --> 03:39.400
He's speaking with Kaspian at the moment.

03:40.200 --> 03:42.660
Then I need to, as well!

03:42.910 --> 03:44.160
Jasmine, wait.

03:45.650 --> 03:50.540
You don't need to go. You're not being 
held responsible for what happened.

03:52.800 --> 03:57.920
So, after being attacked by a giant 
worm and Brald losing an arm,

03:57.920 --> 04:02.230
you were named leader of 
the party? Is that correct?

04:02.230 --> 04:02.950
Yes.

04:03.280 --> 04:07.530
According to Lucas' testimony, during 
the battle against the Elder Woods,

04:07.530 --> 04:12.040
you used Brald, Reginald, 
and Kriol as decoys

04:12.040 --> 04:14.780
in order to flee with 
your partner, Jasmine.

04:15.900 --> 04:18.860
Supposedly, he was going 
to be sacrificed as well,

04:18.860 --> 04:21.320
but managed to escape on his own.

04:22.090 --> 04:24.430
I understand that this is Lucas' claim,

04:24.430 --> 04:26.820
and I intend to speak to Elijah 
about what happened as well.

04:36.070 --> 04:37.310
Senil!

04:38.010 --> 04:39.090
Jasmine?

04:40.980 --> 04:44.600
Did... Father tell you what happened?

04:45.670 --> 04:48.290
It sounds like you had 
it rough. Are you okay?

04:49.890 --> 04:54.090
The Twinhorns, and then 
Note and Elijah, right?

04:54.570 --> 04:59.110
I'm glad to see you've made good 
friends. Look after yourself.

05:00.000 --> 05:03.560
That said, I'd like to give those two 
who exposed you to this kind of danger

05:03.560 --> 05:05.190
a piece of my mind.

05:08.580 --> 05:10.120
I'm just joking.

05:16.370 --> 05:17.840
You seem fine enough.

05:18.380 --> 05:19.860
Lucas!

05:19.860 --> 05:24.390
Which means Kaspian is 
going to question you, too.

05:25.380 --> 05:28.820
Samantha's in no condition to talk,

05:28.820 --> 05:33.680
and Jasmine being a Flamesworth 
means she doesn't have to.

05:33.680 --> 05:35.260
That just leaves you.

05:35.260 --> 05:36.160
And your point is?

05:36.820 --> 05:39.770
Note was the one who got 
Brald and the others killed.

05:40.110 --> 05:41.010
Right?

05:42.110 --> 05:44.360
That's what you tell them
 when they ask.

05:44.360 --> 05:46.390
It was all Note's fault!

05:46.390 --> 05:47.530
Are you out of your mind?!

05:47.530 --> 05:50.920
Yeah? Well, I hate to do it,

05:50.920 --> 05:54.290
but I'm gonna have to make sure 
you can't talk, like Samantha.

06:10.180 --> 06:12.880
What is this?! Something feels different!

06:12.880 --> 06:15.850
Why is my body suddenly so heavy?

06:16.430 --> 06:18.810
What are you people doing?!

06:28.200 --> 06:30.570
Don't just stand there!

06:30.570 --> 06:34.450
Why do you think I pay you so much?!

06:43.960 --> 06:44.990
Mr. Note!

06:46.360 --> 06:48.220
You must let the inquiry run its course.

06:49.720 --> 06:52.410
Sorry about that. My hand slipped.

06:53.780 --> 06:57.980
Mr. Wykes. Go get treated 
in the medical office.

07:05.550 --> 07:08.130
May I have a word with 
Mr. Note in private?

07:12.760 --> 07:14.720
You understand the situation 
you're in, right?

07:15.030 --> 07:17.720
That kind of provocation isn't wise.

07:18.060 --> 07:22.750
Why not? I have the power to erase him.

07:23.730 --> 07:27.630
And the Wykes don't know my identity.

07:28.310 --> 07:29.880
Mr. Bladeheart...

07:30.570 --> 07:36.160
It seems to me like you're trying to 
convince me to let him get away with it.

07:37.620 --> 07:42.140
Do you really believe that you're 
strong enough to protect him from me?

07:43.410 --> 07:45.190
<i>His gaze is so intense...</i>

07:45.850 --> 07:51.580
<i>How many beasts... no, could 
he have even killed people?</i>

07:53.790 --> 07:54.940
Well?

08:00.590 --> 08:04.920
Whether or not you believe it, 
I'm doing this for your own sake.

08:06.380 --> 08:12.790
Even if they don't know who you are, 
should something happen to Lucas,

08:12.790 --> 08:16.010
the Wykes will take action.

08:16.850 --> 08:19.840
They'll likely target not 
just Miss Flamesworth,

08:19.840 --> 08:24.440
but the current and past 
members of the Twinhorns.

08:24.750 --> 08:30.030
Which is why I'd advise against any 
extreme action until you have the strength

08:30.430 --> 08:33.020
to protect everyone you care about.

08:34.030 --> 08:35.450
I understand.

08:36.810 --> 08:38.410
Let's get to the point, then.

08:39.780 --> 08:42.660
Because I wanted to ask 
you about something, too.

08:51.570 --> 08:53.050
The responsibility for 
entering the tomb of terror

08:53.050 --> 08:55.380
without the guild's permission,

08:55.810 --> 09:00.330
and the multiple casualties in the 
battle against the Elder Woods...

09:00.330 --> 09:07.310
Lie with the Note the Augmenter, 
based on the claims of Lucas Wykes.

09:07.770 --> 09:12.050
With the death of the party's 
original leader, Brald Ladon,

09:12.360 --> 09:15.850
there is a discrepancy in the 
claims between Lucas Wykes,

09:15.850 --> 09:19.070
Note the Augmenter, and Elijah Knight.

09:19.330 --> 09:21.200
In light of that,

09:21.630 --> 09:25.340
and after debating the 
matter with this delegation

09:25.340 --> 09:29.210
representing the Adventurer's Guild, 
I hereby present our findings.

09:32.180 --> 09:38.090
Lucas Wykes. You will be stripped of 
your position as an A-Rank Conjurer.

09:40.350 --> 09:41.850
<i>Just as I expected.</i>

09:42.150 --> 09:44.990
You are also forbidden from 
re-registering as an adventurer

09:44.990 --> 09:48.020
until such a time as the guild deems so.

09:48.380 --> 09:52.860
<i>I'm sure Father will arrange it so 
that I get permission soon enough.</i>

09:54.590 --> 09:55.860
Mr. Wykes.

09:56.480 --> 09:59.060
If you would surrender 
your adventurer's card.

09:59.370 --> 10:00.370
Yes, sir.

10:01.490 --> 10:05.370
I'm going to enroll in 
the academy soon, anyway.

10:05.370 --> 10:07.620
I won't need this for a while.

10:10.030 --> 10:11.950
<i>This "punishment" is all for show.</i>

10:11.950 --> 10:14.590
Regarding Note, the Augmenter...

10:15.700 --> 10:21.440
This is the boy who defeated an 
S-class mana beast by himself?

10:22.670 --> 10:27.810
Given your clear animosity towards the 
plaintiff and the Wykes family at large,

10:28.100 --> 10:30.550
I hereby hand down the 
following penalties,

10:30.550 --> 10:33.070
as a representative of 
the Adventurer's Guild:

10:33.390 --> 10:37.250
While Lucas Wykes is 
attending Xyrus Academy,

10:37.250 --> 10:39.520
you are forbidden from 
entering its grounds.

10:39.520 --> 10:42.750
Chairman, I can't accept that punishment!

10:42.750 --> 10:46.450
Lucas betrayed the rest of us! 
Why am even I being punished?!

10:48.460 --> 10:51.580
This is a settled matter, 
with no margin for debate.

10:52.480 --> 10:55.220
If anything, you have avoided 
having to surrender your license

10:55.220 --> 10:57.860
because we considered the situation.

10:58.920 --> 11:02.540
As long as you keep your distance 
from Mr. Wykes and his family,

11:02.540 --> 11:06.690
you will be able to continue 
your career as an adventurer.

11:06.690 --> 11:08.100
<i>And now he's done for...</i>

11:08.100 --> 11:09.110
That is all.

11:10.410 --> 11:13.920
Hang on! You're not going 
to reveal his identity?!

11:14.270 --> 11:18.960
Mr. Note's identity will be a matter of 
record once the inquiry is concluded.

11:19.510 --> 11:21.150
But that information will 
not be publicly available,

11:21.150 --> 11:23.250
in order to protect him and his family.

11:23.250 --> 11:25.910
Any further oversight, regardless of 
his alter-ego while wearing the mask,

11:25.910 --> 11:29.550
will be handled by chosen 
magi of the Guild.

11:29.550 --> 11:30.500
But—

11:31.710 --> 11:36.800
As I said, this is a settled matter, 
with no room for debate, Mr. Wykes.

11:37.550 --> 11:40.710
The inquiry is hereby concluded.

11:43.080 --> 11:44.050
Sir.

11:44.700 --> 11:47.930
Your father requests your presence.

11:53.590 --> 11:59.590
You'll wanna stay five cities away from 
me if you know what's good for you!

11:59.590 --> 12:03.200
Trying to sound tough while 
running away... it's pathetic,

12:03.960 --> 12:04.790
you little brat.

12:06.140 --> 12:07.090
Sir...

12:11.560 --> 12:12.850
Mr. Note.

12:14.350 --> 12:16.200
Come with me.

12:17.170 --> 12:19.210
I'll show you to the back entrance.

12:30.900 --> 12:34.980
Was that farce enough to 
satisfy you, Mr. Note?

12:35.290 --> 12:37.730
Your performance was very convincing.

12:37.960 --> 12:40.210
I appreciate the cooperation.

12:40.210 --> 12:43.880
I don't need any thanks. And 
I didn't do it for your sake.

12:44.260 --> 12:47.990
I just hope you're not going 
to cause any more trouble.

12:48.340 --> 12:49.740
I'm not sure why you think

12:49.740 --> 12:52.500
you'll be able to keep your secret 
from the Wykes for long...

12:53.030 --> 12:56.000
I'm a lot more cautious than I seem.

12:59.240 --> 13:03.010
There may come a time when 
I need a favor from you.

13:03.660 --> 13:06.510
You're a wise enough individual.

13:06.510 --> 13:10.170
I think you'll know who to side 
with when the time comes.

13:10.910 --> 13:12.520
But I'll remember that.

13:13.170 --> 13:18.350
Kaspian was right... you 
are something of a terror.

13:19.270 --> 13:24.160
<i>In the end, Lucas ended up acting 
how you'd expect a Wykes to.</i>

13:24.690 --> 13:30.660
<i>Still, I'm sad that there's 
now this rift between us.</i>

13:39.920 --> 13:41.040
Papa!

13:41.420 --> 13:43.420
Sylvie?!

13:46.420 --> 13:50.340
Is it over yet? Can we go home now?

13:50.340 --> 13:54.430
Yeah, it's all done. Let's head back home.

14:00.660 --> 14:04.930
Once we pass through that gate, we're all 
heading in different directions, huh?

14:05.370 --> 14:10.520
Oh, I forgot... you're not from Sapin.

14:11.650 --> 14:14.290
I was thinking, if you're not busy,

14:14.290 --> 14:18.870
you could stay with us until 
school's about to begin...

14:18.870 --> 14:21.210
I don't intend to join 
you at that school.

14:22.010 --> 14:24.530
But didn't you mention before that

14:24.530 --> 14:28.050
part of the reason you're working hard 
to gain notoriety as an adventurer

14:28.050 --> 14:29.920
is to become famous?

14:30.270 --> 14:34.470
Getting an education at Xyrus 
would only help with that.

14:36.220 --> 14:40.270
Do you really think the best magical 
academy on the continent would accept me?

14:40.270 --> 14:42.530
I could maybe pass the entrance exam,

14:42.530 --> 14:45.730
but you need a ton of money 
and connections to actually—

14:46.020 --> 14:49.130
I can handle that part.

14:49.130 --> 14:52.400
You just need to attend class. 
I'll figure something out.

14:52.400 --> 14:54.490
I can't breathe!

14:55.700 --> 14:58.000
I still haven't agreed yet, okay?

14:59.280 --> 15:01.780
You know Lucas is going to 
be attending too, right?

15:01.780 --> 15:04.000
So, you don't care what's gonna happen 
when it's just the two of us...

15:07.460 --> 15:13.510
Jasmine. Could you escort Elijah home? 
There's something I need to take care of.

15:14.510 --> 15:18.920
<i>Unbelievable! I guess I've gotta 
figure out what classes to take.</i>

15:19.900 --> 15:22.270
<i>I appreciate him worrying 
about me, though.</i>

15:29.550 --> 15:31.810
I'm glad to see you're cautious enough to

15:32.160 --> 15:33.970
let the two of them leave without you.

15:34.280 --> 15:37.630
I'm glad you were willing to cooperate 
with my silly little plan.

15:38.330 --> 15:41.180
Lucas won't suspect a thing for a while.

15:43.230 --> 15:45.070
Let's get to the point, then.

15:45.070 --> 15:47.840
Because I wanted to ask 
you about something, too.

15:49.360 --> 15:51.590
You're clever enough to realize that

15:51.890 --> 15:58.500
by helping me, it's in both your 
best interest and the guild's.

15:58.500 --> 16:02.930
The Wykes family has used unscrupulous 
methods to produce mages for a long time.

16:03.590 --> 16:09.610
It would be unwise for both the guild, 
and me personally, to make an enemy of them.

16:09.610 --> 16:14.720
I realize that. And Lucas probably 
wants to learn my identity.

16:15.070 --> 16:18.430
He'll try to pressure 
you all to reveal it.

16:18.840 --> 16:20.130
Most likely.

16:20.130 --> 16:22.730
But you shouldn't let him know.

16:23.370 --> 16:27.920
If you do that, I'm willing 
to promise my support

16:28.240 --> 16:32.630
for you and the guild once 
I've grown even more powerful.

16:37.130 --> 16:38.320
Fair enough.

16:39.060 --> 16:42.850
We'll gladly help in whatever way we can.

16:43.260 --> 16:46.100
Thank you. I'm glad we could 
come to an understanding.

16:47.340 --> 16:49.520
So, was there anything else?

16:54.400 --> 16:55.860
A parting gift.

16:58.320 --> 16:59.630
What is this?

16:59.940 --> 17:02.090
Use it to take some preventive measures,

17:02.090 --> 17:03.870
so that you'll be able to protect 
yourself going forward.

17:03.870 --> 17:05.110
<i>Preventative measures?</i>

17:06.310 --> 17:10.530
<i>Dawn's Ballad shouldn't be an 
issue as long as I don't draw it.</i>

17:11.080 --> 17:13.330
<i>If there's anything to worry about,</i>

17:13.330 --> 17:15.570
<i>it's the fact that Lucas 
has seen Sylvie before.</i>

17:19.910 --> 17:23.950
Whoa, whoa... how many 
different forms do you have?

17:23.950 --> 17:25.110
I dunno.

17:26.330 --> 17:28.570
I'm tired.

17:29.160 --> 17:31.130
Talk about convenient.

17:49.660 --> 17:51.030
Welcome!

17:51.910 --> 17:53.630
What's wrong? You lost?

17:53.630 --> 17:59.140
No, my dad sent me to buy a 
dimension ring that fits my thumb.

17:59.140 --> 18:04.140
That's not gonna come cheap. 
Does your dad realize that?

18:05.000 --> 18:05.890
Will this cover it?

18:09.820 --> 18:13.510
I can't believe it took 
most of the gold coins.

18:14.250 --> 18:18.530
Oh, well. Now I'm ready 
for a regular school life.

18:20.860 --> 18:23.600
<i>It's been two years 
since I put this mask on</i>

18:24.070 --> 18:28.200
<i>to ensure that my family would 
be safe from royal influence.</i>

18:31.930 --> 18:37.090
<i>I'm curious what being an 
ordinary student will be like.</i>

18:50.750 --> 18:51.680
<i>Eleanor?</i>

18:52.450 --> 18:53.470
<i>I'm home.</i>

18:58.030 --> 18:59.110
<i>Say that again?</i>

19:00.070 --> 19:04.370
I said, "welcome home!" 
and "I was really worried!"

19:04.690 --> 19:05.560
Arthur!

19:05.560 --> 19:06.600
Welcome home.

19:08.870 --> 19:11.030
How are your injuries? Are you okay?

19:11.030 --> 19:12.880
Everything alright?

19:15.350 --> 19:19.210
I'm so glad to see you home and safe.

19:19.760 --> 19:23.980
I'm sorry for always worrying you, Mom.

19:27.000 --> 19:29.890
Sorry to break up the 
heart-warming reunion,

19:29.890 --> 19:34.510
but we were hoping to 
welcome your son home too.

19:34.510 --> 19:36.000
Vincent...

19:38.290 --> 19:42.530
I see. So Jasmine went to 
join up with the Twinhorns.

19:42.530 --> 19:43.820
What about Lilia?

19:44.050 --> 19:45.600
Well, Lilia...

19:45.600 --> 19:47.790
Lilia is already at Xyrus Academy!

19:47.790 --> 19:49.830
I'm talking here.

19:51.130 --> 19:54.430
Really? That's fantastic news.

19:54.430 --> 19:58.970
Speaking of news, I was shocked to 
hear you took down the guardian spirit

19:58.970 --> 20:00.230
of the Elder Woods.

20:00.230 --> 20:02.220
I guess you're even stronger now.

20:02.670 --> 20:05.970
By the way, Dad, what stage are you at?

20:05.970 --> 20:12.630
The thing is... I've been kind of stuck 
at deep orange ever since you left.

20:12.630 --> 20:17.250
I've tried to meditate and purify 
my mana, but I've made no progress.

20:17.250 --> 20:19.470
Try using this, then.

20:22.860 --> 20:23.740
What is it?

20:24.520 --> 20:27.490
It's the Elder Wood's beast core.

20:29.090 --> 20:32.250
I think it should help you get through 
what's blocking you from the next stage.

20:32.480 --> 20:36.900
I can't! You risked your life to get this!

20:36.900 --> 20:38.750
I can't accept it!

20:39.270 --> 20:40.900
Please do, Dad.

20:40.900 --> 20:42.940
Let me see! Let me see!

20:42.940 --> 20:46.510
You don't want your son 
outdoing you, do you?

20:46.510 --> 20:49.260
Arthur... don't tell me...

20:49.880 --> 20:53.270
Yep. I'm at light orange now.

20:53.270 --> 20:54.310
Incredible!

20:54.820 --> 20:56.270
I can't believe it.

20:57.760 --> 21:01.530
You had better not sulk 
the next time we spar.

21:03.460 --> 21:04.550
Of course.

22:47.620 --> 22:49.410
This mana I sense...
